"></mspace></mstyle><mi>θ</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.788</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> rounded to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"141\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> decimal places.  </p>\n</div></div>",
